  "details": "me and a group of friends all make animations using predominantly screen-space shaders and particle systems (think Team Party People, Latin Gang, etc.) and one of us recently got suspended for this which I think is ridiculous when the content gating system exists. there should really be an option for seizure/flashing lights because this form of animation is still an artform and taking that away from the community would destroy a whole environment of animators and enthusiasts, sure it's not for everyone, but that's what the content gating system is there for.",
